 of Oct 12, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Logan County. On the middle, April to May 2025 ran 159% of normal and November to December 2025 fell to 39%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 48% of normal on the middle. All 7 grids had their driest year in 1963.</p>"}
